      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Hillsborough preserves more stone arch bridges than any other New Hampshire town, a cluster honored as a National Historic Civil Engineering Landmark.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
